{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e7ac8412-6937-8f98-bf03-82afa0128e82",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T14:04:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Josephine Iannuccilli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:00:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:01:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, sorry to bother you. I know this is probably a silly thing to call about, but my street still hasn't been plowed since the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:01:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not at all, that's what we're here for. Which storm are you talking about, the one over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:01:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, sorry, last weekend, the one that was snow and then turned to rain. Sunday into Monday. It's Wednesday now and nobody has come down our street at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:01:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So nothing since Sunday into Monday. What street are you on, hon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:01:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sorry, I'd rather not give the address on the phone if that's all right. Is it something you need? I can tell you it's a small side street, a dead end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:01:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do need the street name to get it to the right crew, or at least to pass it along. Could you give me just the street name, no house number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:01:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I'm sorry, I'd really rather not. Can I just ask in general when the side streets get done? Is there a schedule?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:02:06-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can tell you in general. The main roads and the hills get done first, then the side streets and dead ends after that. After a mix like this one, with the rain and the freeze, the packed stuff takes a second pass. So dead ends can be later than you'd like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:02:25-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Sorry, I know this is silly, but it's the bus. My daughter's school bus now comes very early in the morning. Like way earlier than it used to. I think because the driver can't turn around on our street, so they changed the pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:02:41-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I see. So the bus is picking up earlier because of the unplowed street. Let me make sure I have that right, the bus has moved its time up, and she's out there in the dark."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:02:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. It's about twenty to six now. Sorry, that's the only reason I'm pushing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:03:00-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's a good reason to call. Here's what I can do. I'll write it up as an unplowed dead end with a school bus issue, and I'll flag it for the crew supervisor. Do you want a call back when I hear anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:03:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes please, sorry. The number is four oh one, five five five, oh one six six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:03:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one six six. And that's Josephine?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:03:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Josephine Iannuccilli. Sorry, it's a long one. I-A-N-N-U-C-C-I-L-L-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:03:31-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, thank you. Now, without the street name, I'm going to have a hard time. If you change your mind, even just the street, I can put it right on the ticket. Otherwise the callback will have to start by asking you for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:03:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Sorry. Okay, I guess that makes sense. It's easier to just tell you then, I suppose. Hold on, the line's a little [line breaks up] can you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:03:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I lost you for a second. Go ahead, I'm here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:04:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, can you hear me now? I said I'll give it to you when the supervisor calls. I'd rather do it that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:04:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, that works. I'll note that you'll give the street when we call back. Most likely someone will reach out today or tomorrow morning. If the plow comes through first, that's even better."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:04:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Sorry again for the trouble."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:04:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble. Take care, Josephine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T14:04:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye now."
    }
  ],
